    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101423" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συσσῴζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help to save</i> or <i>preserve</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1209
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1389
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				270
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμᾶς τε καὶ ἡμᾶς αὐτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.74
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ μεθ᾽ ὑμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					66
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πολίτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					7.62.18
				</span></i>
			 (Seleucia Pieria, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινάς τισι</span>
			<i>save</i> them <i>together with, as well as</i> others, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.11.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>observe completely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.14.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.47.10
			</span></i>.</div>
